# A given GA 0.3 mm off its shell (MOVGAB 1 moves it), a GS 15 degrees off the
# normal of the shells (GSPROJ), a fastener on the free edge (PROJTOL,
# ACTVTOL), a GS far from the shells (GSMOVE, GSTOL), a DRATIO other than 1
# and a diameter reduction (NREDIA).
